      "writtenOn": "2026-05-28T07:17:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My suggestion is to do the same thing we are doing at `L108-110`\n```\n// Only the current revision is mergeable. Others always fail.\nreturn Response.ok(result);\n```\n\nThat empty response maps to:\n\n```\n        result.mergeable \u003d false;\n        result.commitMerged \u003d false;\n        result.contentMerged \u003d false;\n```\n\nI think it is appropriate because this represents and unmerged change that is not mergeable.\n\nWDYT?\n\nLet me propose a follow up change",
